WEBVTT

00:04:28.876 --> 00:04:33.036
I started to realize
that, really, they were the questions.

00:04:33.076 --> 00:04:34.356
They were the big ones,

00:04:34.356 --> 00:04:36.156
I just hadn't known it yet.

00:04:38.116 --> 00:04:39.956
So here's what I found out.

00:04:40.796 --> 00:04:43.636
Lots of people feel the way I do
about sad music,

00:04:43.676 --> 00:04:45.716
especially sensitive types.

00:04:45.756 --> 00:04:47.996
People play the happy songs
on their playlists

00:04:48.036 --> 00:04:50.396
about 175 times on average,

00:04:50.396 --> 00:04:53.156
but they play the sad songs 800 times.

00:04:54.116 --> 00:04:57.276
And they tell researchers
that they associate sad music

00:04:57.276 --> 00:05:00.556
with beauty and wonder and transcendence,